query:
UPDATE course_lessons SET content = REPLACE(content,
  '**WARNING:** NEVER bypass or "jumper out" a safety device to keep a machine running. Bypassing a safety circuit is a severe violation of OSHA regulations and puts operators at immediate risk of amputation or death. If a safety circuit is tripping, find and fix the root cause.',
  '**WARNING:** NEVER bypass or "jumper out" a safety device to keep a machine running in production. Bypassing a safety circuit without proper authorization is a severe violation of OSHA regulations and puts operators at immediate risk of amputation or death. If a safety circuit is tripping, find and fix the root cause.\n\n*Maintenance exception:* During troubleshooting, qualified maintenance personnel may temporarily bypass safety devices **only** under a documented procedure (e.g., ANSI/NFPA 79 Annex B) with: (1) written authorization, (2) alternative protective measures in place, (3) reduced speed/limited motion mode if available, and (4) immediate restoration after troubleshooting. Many machines provide a maintenance bypass key switch for this purpose.'
) WHERE id = 120020;

